# VS Code REST Client 용. 각 ### 블록 위의 「Send Request」로 실행.
# 먼저 다른 터미널에서 npm start.
@host = http://localhost:3000
@playerId = b356bb24-e90c-48ff-a828-8352609d5925

### 닉네임 중복 확인
GET {{host}}/players/check?nickname=max

### 가입
POST {{host}}/players
Content-Type: application/json

{"team":"플링커","name":"이현수","nickname":"max"}

### 가입 (같은 닉네임 → 409)
POST {{host}}/players
Content-Type: application/json

{"team":"플링커","name":"이현수","nickname":"max"}

### 가입 (아틀라스 밖 글자 → 400)
POST {{host}}/players
Content-Type: application/json

{"team":"플링커","name":"이현수","nickname":"뷁"}

### 프로필 수정
PATCH {{host}}/players/me
Content-Type: application/json
X-Player-Id: {{playerId}}

{"team":"서북"}

### 프로필 삭제 (탈퇴 · 캐릭터·기록 전부 삭제)
DELETE {{host}}/players/me
X-Player-Id: {{playerId}}

### 삭제 후 수정 → 404
PATCH {{host}}/players/me
Content-Type: application/json
X-Player-Id: {{playerId}}

{"team":"서북"}
